      "post_id": "2096146817251500386",
      "url": "https://x.com/Pirat_Nation/status/2096146817251500386",
      "text": "The European Union is making cheap online shopping more expensive.\n\nFrom July 1, 2026, packages worth less than €150 coming into the EU will have a €3 customs charge for each product category in the order, affecting platforms like AliExpress, Temu and Shein.\n\nFor example, if you order a shirt, shoes and a bag and they fall into three different categories, you could end up paying €9 in extra charges.\n\nThe fee is officially paid by the seller or importer, but the extra costs may be passed on to customers through higher prices.\n\nThe EU says the change is meant to deal with the huge number of cheap packages entering Europe,",
      "original_text": "The European Union is making cheap online shopping more expensive.\n\nFrom July 1, 2026, packages worth less than €150 coming into the EU will have a €3 customs charge for each product category in the order,  affecting platforms like AliExpress, Temu and Shein.\n\nFor example, if you order a shirt, shoes and a bag and they fall into three different categories, you could end up paying €9 in extra charges.\n\nThe fee is officially paid by the seller or importer, but the extra costs may be passed on to customers through higher prices.\n\nThe EU says the change is meant to deal with the huge number of cheap packages entering Europe,",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "欧盟正在让廉价网购变得更贵。\n\n从 2026 年 7 月 1 日起，进入欧盟、价值低于 €150 的包裹，将按订单中的每个产品类别收取 €3 的海关费用，影响 AliExpress、Temu 和 Shein 等平台。\n\n例如，如果你订购一件衬衫、一双鞋和一个包，并且它们属于三个不同类别，你最终可能要额外支付 €9 的费用。\n\n这笔费用官方上由卖家或进口商支付，但额外成本可能会通过更高的价格转嫁给客户。\n\n欧盟表示，这一变化是为了应对进入欧洲的大量廉价包裹，",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户在 公开社媒上讨论与品牌相关的购物体验。",
